WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.834
-Welcome back, everybody. We are
hanging out with Queen Latifah!

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:05.300
[ Cheers and applause ]
Come on.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.467
-Wow.

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:09.367
-We are about to play
"The Whisper Challenge."

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:10.367
Here we go.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:13.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:15.801
-Whisper Challenge.

00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:17.934
-Oh, wow.
Here's how the game works.

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:21.067
One person puts on
these headphones

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:22.834
with loud music playing.

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:24.667
And then the other person
picks up a card,

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:26.868
reads the random phrase
on that card,

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:27.968
and the person
wearing the headphones

00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:29.834
has to try and guess what
they just said.

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:31.467
Queen Latifah, you're my guest.

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:33.100
Please put on these headphones
first.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.734
-Oh, my God.
-These are soundproof.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.133
Where's your left?
-I see you.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:37.868
I have a pair of those. They
really are noise-canceling.

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:40.133
-Right? These are the --
You can do this at home.

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.901
Do I have it right? Yeah, left.
Okay, ready?

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:43.634
I'm going to put on some jams.

00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:46.200
Alright.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.133
You can't hear nothing.

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:50.167
-How am I supposed concentrate
with that on?!

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:52.200
-Okay. Here we go. Perfect.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.734
Alright. Ready?

00:00:55.234 --> 00:00:56.667
Mm-hmm.

00:00:58.067 --> 00:01:00.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:02.834
I just make you laugh just
by looking at you.

00:01:02.834 --> 00:01:04.834
Hallmark card.

00:01:04.834 --> 00:01:06.267
-Hallmark card.

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:07.534
-What?! Yes!
[ Ding! ]

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:12.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.734
That's called chemistry.

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.167
You can't buy that!

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.501
-Oh, my God.
-Hallmark card.

00:01:18.501 --> 00:01:20.634
How did you get that?

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:22.400
Wow! That's fantastic!
You know me so well.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.934
-I hope I'm as good as you are.

00:01:23.934 --> 00:01:25.267
-I think we're going to be great
at this.

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:27.501
Come on. I can't believe --
That's never happened.

00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:29.567
-That's a lot of time in a club
when you can't hear.

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:32.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:35.100
Got to get that number.
So, do I take this one?

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.200
Okay. He's jamming.
He's jamming. He's rocking.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.033
Oh, this is hard.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.567
Seven-layer dip.

00:01:43.567 --> 00:01:46.534
-Cellphone. Cellphone.

