Hair.
-Layer.

00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:29.200
This is not going to work.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:31.434
Seven --
-Stefan.

00:02:31.434 --> 00:02:35.100
-Wait, one, two, three,
four, five, six...

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.968
-One, two, three, four, five,
six, seven.

00:02:36.968 --> 00:02:38.367
-Seven.
-Seven!

00:02:38.367 --> 00:02:40.634
-Layer dip.

00:02:40.634 --> 00:02:42.167
-Seven.
-Seven-layer dip.

00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:44.801
