00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.868
Seven-layer dip.

00:03:06.868 --> 00:03:08.167
You can't make it all the way
down there.

00:03:08.167 --> 00:03:10.200
-This is hard.
-That was a hard one. I'm sorry.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:11.834
